nonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'completed_system_trucks': {'definition': 'Count of uncensored completed system intervals used by system-time summaries.', 'unit': 'trucks', 'population': 'Only trucks whose final scale_out service completes by minute 720.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'resource_busy_minutes': {'definition': 'Sum of service interval lengths, including active services clipped at 720.', 'unit': 'resource-minutes', 'population': 'All initial physical resources, weighted by their resource-minutes.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'resource_down_minutes': {'definition': "Sum across resources of each resource's union of effective disruption intervals, clipped to the horizon.", 'unit': 'resource-minutes', 'population': 'All initial physical resources, weighted by their resource-minutes.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'resource_available_minutes': {'definition': 'Total resource horizon minus union downtime.', 'unit': 'resource-minutes', 'population': 'All initial physical resources, weighted by their resource-minutes.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'resource_idle_minutes': {'definition': 'Available resource time minus busy time; excludes downtime.', 'unit': 'resource-minutes', 'population': 'All initial physical resources, weighted by their resource-minutes.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [0,720] minutes; services may finish at 720 but cannot start at 720.'}, 'resource_gross_minutes': {'definition': 'Number of initial resources multiplied by 720 minutes.', 'unit': 'resource-minutes', 'population': 'All initial physical resources, weighted by their resource-minutes.', 'window': 'Observed canonical day [